<title>USA: BroadBand authorizes 1.3 mln shr buyback.</title>
<headline>BroadBand authorizes 1.3 mln shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>RESEARCH TRIANGLE PARK, N.C. 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>BroadBand Technologies Inc said on Monday that its board of directors has authorized the repurchase of up to 1.3 million shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The shares represent about 10 percent of the company's 13.3 million shares outstanding, BroadBand said.</p>
<p>The repurchases will be made in open market or privately negotiated transactions, BroadBand said.</p>
</text>
